pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% Regression test: `Cardinality::lower_rhs` had the same dropped-temporary
% escalation, reachable by an i64 underflow of `degree - amount` as well as by
% an amount that does not fit i64. The guard correctly refused the wrap, but
% the escalation it handed off to did nothing. Both routes are exercised here.
f 1 ;
pol 1 9223372036854775807 - ;
pol 2 9223372036854775807 - ;
e 1 x1 1 x2 >= -18446744073709551613 : 3 ;
pol 2 18446744073709551616 - ;
e 1 x1 1 x2 >= -27670116110564327422 : 4 ;
output NONE;
conclusion NONE;
end pseudo-Boolean proof;
